{
  "job_B9.6.1_20251003_115048": {
    "text": "Ic Beda Cristes \u00feeow and m\u00e6ssepreost sende gretan \u00f0one leofastan cyning Ceolwulf.\n& ic \u00f0e sende \u00fe\u00e6t spell, \u00fe\u00e6t ic niwan awrat be Angel\u00feeode & Seaxum, \u00f0e sylfum to r\u00e6danne & on\n& ic getreowige on \u00f0ine geornfulnysse, for\u00feon \u00f0u eart swy\u00f0e gymende & smeagende ealdra manna\nFor\u00f0on \u00feis gewrit o\u00f0\u00f0e hit god saga\u00f0 be godum mannum, & se \u00f0e hit gehyre\u00fe, he onhyre\u00fe \u00feam, o\u00f0\u00f0e\nFor\u00feon hit is god godne to herianne & yfelne to leanne, \u00fe\u00e6t se ge\u00f0eo se \u00fee hit gehyre.\nGif se o\u00f0er nolde, hu wur\u00f0 he elles gel\u00e6red?\nFor \u00feinre \u00f0earfe & for \u00feinre \u00f0eode ic \u00feis awrat; for\u00feon \u00f0e God to cyninge geceas, \u00fee gedafena\u00f0 \u00feine\n& \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0y l\u00e6s tweoge hw\u00e6\u00f0er \u00feis so\u00f0 sy, ic cy\u00f0e hwanan me \u00feas spell coman.\n\u00c6rest me w\u00e6s fultumiend & lareow se arwur\u00f0a abbad Albinus, se w\u00e6s wide gefaren & gel\u00e6red, &\nSwy\u00f0ost he me s\u00e6de of \u00feeodores gemynde, se w\u00e6s biscop on Cantwara byrig, & Adrianus abbud,\nEall \u00fe\u00e6t he on Cantwara m\u00e6g\u00fee & eac on \u00feam \u00feeodlandum \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r to ge\u00f0eodde w\u00e6ron, eall \u00f0\u00e6t he\nFram fruman \u00feyssa boca o\u00f0 \u00fea tid, \u00fee Angelcyn Cristes geleafan onfeng, of ealldra manna s\u00e6genum;\nSwy\u00f0e fela hi me s\u00e6don fram gehwylcum biscopum, & hwylcum cyninga tidum Eastseaxe &\n\u00d0urh Albinus swi\u00f0ost ic ge\u00f0ristl\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6t ic dorste \u00feis weorc ongynnan, & eac mid Danieles \u00fe\u00e6s\nFela he me s\u00e6de ymbe Su\u00f0seaxe & embe Westseaxe; & eac ymbe Wiht \u00f0\u00e6t igland swy\u00f0ost he me\n& \u00feurh Cedde \u00feone arwur\u00f0an Myrcna bisceop & Ceaddan ymbe Myrcna \u00feeode & Eastseaxena; & eac\n\u00dea \u00feing \u00fee on Eastenglum gewordene w\u00e6ron, sume we \u00fea of ealdra manna gewritum o\u00f0\u00f0e s\u00e6gene\n& \u00fe\u00e6t on Lindese geworden w\u00e6s ymbe Cristes geleafan, \u00feurh gesegene \u00f0\u00e6s arwur\u00f0an biscopes\n& eac \u00fe\u00e6t we on Nor\u00f0anhymbrum geacsedon ymbe Cristes geleafan o\u00f0 \u00f0ysne andweardan d\u00e6g,\n\u00d0\u00e6t ic be \u00f0am halgan f\u00e6der Cu\u00f0byrhte wrat o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00feysse bec o\u00f0\u00f0e on o\u00f0re, \u00fea d\u00e6da his lifes, sume\n& \u00feone leornere ic nu eadmodlice bidde & halsige, gif he hw\u00e6t ymbe \u00f0is on o\u00f0re wisan gemete o\u00f0\u00f0e",
